OL,3,AMan jailed for life over knife attack
OL,4,Aattempt at Israeli embassy in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FA failed asylum seeker who tried to
OL,7,Fbreak into the Israeli embassy in
OL,8,FLondon to carry out a knife attack has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed for life with a minimum
OL,10,Fterm of 20 years.
OL,12,FAbdullah Albadri was carrying two
OL,13,Fknives when police officers caught him
OL,14,Fas he tried to climb over a fence into
OL,15,Fthe Kensington embassy on 28 April
OL,16,F2025.
OL,18,FThe 34-year-old from Kuwait had arrived
OL,19,Fin the UK on a small boat 16 days
OL,20,Fearlier, having first entered country
OL,21,Fillegally four years earlier.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
